    "hook": "You open a message you swore you'd delete—and don't look away.",
    "curiosity": "What happens when the past slips back into your fingers? You've told yourself you're done, yet here it is: a message from someone you once loved, once hurt, once forgot. You scroll, you hesitate, and then you read it again—just to feel something familiar, even if it's not what you want.",
